    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117880/extras/257629967083d3dcb794bfcaf962f820.avif?t=1681992212\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117880/extras/a31ed43793f7ac38639db29d54a20858.webp?t=1681992212\" /></div><br>An alien lab experimenting on Earth? It's time to call the mercenary team on duty to sweep the invaders by firing, beating and bombing.<br>Inspired by the 8-bit games and by the movies from the 80's, your goal is to blow things up, defeat aliens and fight bizarre bosses in this platformer 2D with classic mechanics.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117880/extras/1b3697b2bb51a765196afaacdc2dd2fc.poster.avif?t=1681992212\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117880/extras/1b3697b2bb51a765196afaacdc2dd2fc.webm?t=1681992212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117880/extras/1b3697b2bb51a765196afaacdc2dd2fc.mp4?t=1681992212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117880/extras/05b73e8e59cae6e87eea9181cc1fff03.webp?t=1681992212\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Finn</strong>, the bodybuilder, former Marine, former grill man and former television technician;<br></li><li><strong>Becca</strong>, the deadliest and toughest girl on the planet;<br></li><li><strong>Teddy</strong>, the armored dog (that's what you read), who suffered experiments in this alien lab and now wants revenge, or just find its owner.<br></li><li><strong>Jack</strong>, another experiment in 